  "description": "A once happy household begins to crumble after a new family member moves in. Slowly, he takes everything the protagonist holds dear, from his bedroom and his parents' affection to even his beloved piano. But there is another reason for his deep hatred: a disturbing, sinister side of this newcomer that no one else seems to notice. One day, he returns home to discover something unexpected in his own room.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/howtotameadog)",
